dwn remove help

alias:
  remove, rm

example:
  dwn rm 1a2b3c4d 2b3c4d5c
  dwn rm -a
  dwn rm -a -f

options:
  -a  remove all items from list.
  -c  remove all items from list with complete downloads.
  -f  remove local file counterparts if any from specified items.
  -i  remove all items from list with incomplete downloads.
